      "content": "it's not just a \"feeling\" though. it's literally the math. i look at my bank account and then i look at the cost of living and it just doesn't add up. even if i work more hours i'm just losing more sleep and more health just to pay for a room i'm only in to sleep in. it feels like a trap that's mathematically impossible to win. like, why even stay in the game if the numbers are always in the red?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
